          title: 'Past Simple and used to — Places and Memories',
          content: `## Past Simple Tense

Use **Past Simple** for completed actions in the past.

**Regular verbs:** add -ed
- walk → walked · play → played · visit → visited

**Irregular verbs (must memorise!):**
| Base | Past | Base | Past |
|------|------|------|------|
| go | went | come | came |
| see | saw | buy | bought |
| eat | ate | take | took |
| have | had | say | said |
| make | made | give | gave |

**Questions:** *Did you go to the park? / Where did she go?*
**Negatives:** *I did not eat breakfast. / He did not come to school.*

## used to

Use **used to** for past habits that no longer happen:
- *I used to play marbles when I was a child.*
- *People used to send letters, not emails.*
- *We did not use to have smartphones.*

## Places in Town

castle · bazaar · fortress · mosque · church · cathedral · theatre · stadium · square · library · gym · sports centre`,
