          title: 'Health & Life Stages',
          content: `## Healthy Life

### Healthy habits
- **Eat fruits and vegetables**
- **Drink water** (8 glasses a day)
- **Exercise** regularly (sports, walking)
- **Sleep** 8–10 hours
- **Wash hands** before eating
- **Brush teeth** twice a day

### Unhealthy habits
- too much sugar / junk food
- not enough sleep
- too much screen time
- smoking
- skipping breakfast

### Common health words
- **healthy** — здрав; **unhealthy** — нездрав
- **sick / ill** — болен
- **medicine** — лек
- **doctor / dentist** — лекар / забар
- **hospital** — болница

### Sentences
- *I have a headache.* (главоболка)
- *She has a stomachache.* (стомак)
- *I feel tired.*
- *Go to bed early and rest.*

## Life Stages

| Stage | English |
|---|---|
| baby | бебе |
| child | дете |
| teenager | тинејџер |
| adult | возрасен |
| elderly / old person | стар човек |

### „When I was a child...“ (Past Simple)
- *When I was 5, I lived in Skopje.*
- *When she was a baby, she had blonde hair.*

### „When I grow up...“ (Future)
- *When I grow up, I want to be a doctor.*
- *I will travel around the world.*`,
